    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s10-t01-mother-01-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第1题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s10-t01-mother-01",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（19联考）小王在商店消费了90元，口袋里只有1张50元、4张20元、8张10元的钞票，他共有几种付款方式，可以使店家不用找零钱？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "5"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "6"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "7"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "8"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          100
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          94
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s10-t01-mother-01-p100.webp",
            "alt": "排列组合问题（一） · 母题精讲1 · 讲义第94页",
            "pdfPage": 100
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s10-t01-mother-01-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s10-t01-mother-01",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们按是否使用50元钞票分类，同面额的钞票只区分张数，不区分具体哪一张。设20元、10元分别用b张、c张。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "不用50元时，有20b＋10c＝90，即2b＋c＝9。受b≤4、c≤8限制，(b,c)只有(1,7)、(2,5)、(3,3)、(4,1)，共4种。使用50元时，剩40元，2b＋c＝4，只有(0,4)、(1,2)、(2,0)，共3种。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "两类互斥，相加得到4＋3＝7种，我们选C。把9张10元也算进去会违反只有8张10元的限制。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "付款方式按面额张数枚举，先分类，再检查每种面额的库存上限。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
