    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s10-t01-mother-02-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第2题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s10-t01-mother-02",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25国考）某竞赛由5道次序固定的判断题组成，参赛者起始为0分，每答对1题加1分，每答错1题扣1分。小王作答了所有试题，答完每道题时当前的得分都不低于1分。问他的答题情况有多少种不同的可能？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "7"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "6"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "4"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "3"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          100
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          94
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
